  lg_ability_heads: "Many Heads",
  lg_ability_hoard: "Kingpin's Hoard",
  lg_ability_sugarrush: "Sugar Rush",
  lg_ability_encore: "Comedy and Tragedy",
  lg_abilityDesc_heads: "Every right answer cuts a head. Cut all three to burn the stumps for 2. A miss grows two back.",
  lg_abilityDesc_hoard: "Right answers rob him of a coin; a miss lets his rats steal one back. Spend 3 on a Cheese Bomb (3 damage) or 2 on a Lucky Tail (saves your next heart). At 5 coins the rats throw a bomb for you.",
  lg_abilityDesc_sugarrush: "Three right answers fill her jar and start a Sugar Rush: your next 2 answers deal 2 extra damage each. A miss crashes it.",
  lg_abilityDesc_encore: "Right answers win applause: the 4th brings an Encore for 3 extra damage. Two misses make a Plot Twist that puts the Encore one right answer away.",
  lg_ability_shackles: "Shackles",
  lg_abilityDesc_shackles: "Chain all three heads for 4 extra damage: the Fire head with any right answer, the Iron head with a clean typed answer, the Shadow head with the first right answer after a miss (or a blocked attack). A miss lets the Fire head slip free.",
  lg_fx_shatter: "Shattered!",
  lg_fx_rewind: "Rewind!",
  lg_minionQ: "Skeleton! Answer to shatter it.",
  lg_ability_plates: "Forge Plates",
  lg_ability_minions: "Raise Dead",
  lg_ability_threeheads: "Three Heads",
  lg_ability_horizon: "Event Horizon",
  lg_ability_verdicts: "Verdicts",
  lg_ability_current: "Ride the Current",
  lg_ability_vent: "Pressure Vent",
  lg_ability_loop: "Time Loop",
  lg_ability_wards: "Blood Wards",
  lg_ability_drums: "Storm Measure",
  lg_ability_prism: "Prism",
  lg_ability_puppets: "Stolen Puppets",
  lg_ability_allin: "All In",
  lg_ability_wildfire: "Wildfire Comb",
  lg_ability_mirror: "Mirror Shield",
  lg_ability_scream: "Call and Response",
  lg_ability_execute: "Reaper's Line",
  lg_ability_sleep: "Deep Sleep",
  lg_ability_moons: "Moonfall",
  lg_ability_rally: "Starball Rally",
  lg_ability_grace: "Grace of the Wheel",
  lg_abilityDesc_plates: "Clean typed answers crack his 2 plates. Break both to deal 2 and expose him: your next 3 right answers deal +1 each. Then he forges new plates.",
  lg_abilityDesc_minions: "Every 3 answers the Lich raises a card you already knew. Destroy it for 3; if it escapes, he heals 2.",
  lg_abilityDesc_threeheads: "His health is three heads. You strike the next head in line, or tap one to aim. Each head you fell gives you its power.",
  lg_abilityDesc_horizon: "Your hits fall into its disk. Every third, the disk collapses for one and a half times the damage.",
  lg_abilityDesc_verdicts: "The Judge marks your cards: Wrath cards deal +2, Mercy cards forgive a miss.",
  lg_abilityDesc_current: "Right answers row you up the current; on the crest every right answer hits +1. A miss drags you down two.",
  lg_abilityDesc_vent: "Right answers build heat. Vent any time for heat minus 1, or let it reach 4 and erupt for 3. A miss cools it.",
  lg_abilityDesc_loop: "Sand rewinds a miss: no heart lost, and the card comes back two questions later. A full hourglass stops time: your next right answer deals double.",
  lg_abilityDesc_wards: "Three right in a row raise a blood ward. A ward takes your next lost heart and bursts for 2. With a ward up, three more in a row feast for 3.",
  lg_abilityDesc_drums: "Raid answers march on his storm orbs in measures of four: each right answer on beats 1 to 3 charges an orb, and the 4th beat brings the thunder, 1 per charged orb.",
  lg_abilityDesc_prism: "Each card shows a color. Answer right to collect it: red, green and blue together burst for 2.",
  lg_abilityDesc_puppets: "Every 4th right answer steals one of his puppets (up to 2). Your puppets kick him for 1 on every answer, even a miss, but a miss lets him yank one back.",
  lg_abilityDesc_allin: "Arm the axe before a typed answer: right deals +3, wrong costs an extra heart (never your last). Then it rests for 3 answers.",
  lg_abilityDesc_wildfire: "Each right answer sets a cell of her comb alight, and the fire spreads by itself. When all six burn, the hive goes up for 2. A miss lets a drone douse a cell.",
  lg_abilityDesc_mirror: "Every 4th card is her gaze (every 3rd in phase 3). Answer it right to reflect it for 3, or 2 by choice.",
  lg_abilityDesc_scream: "She screams at every phase line and after each of your misses. Your next right answer silences her for 2.",
  lg_abilityDesc_execute: "Every right answer raises the scythe line on his health bar. When his health falls to the line, the rest of the phase is reaped at once.",
  lg_abilityDesc_sleep: "While it sleeps, right answers sink it deeper: the 4th is a Nightmare for 3. A miss wakes it; two right in a row sing it back to sleep for 2.",
  lg_abilityDesc_moons: "Every 3rd clean typed answer flings a moon into orbit. Two answers later it crashes into him for 2, even if you miss.",
  lg_abilityDesc_rally: "Each right answer returns her star ball. Four in a row and it bursts for 3. Miss, and she catches it.",
  lg_abilityDesc_grace: "Each right answer lights one of its open eyes (2, then 4, then 6 as it unfolds); a miss darkens one. Light them all for Grace: a lost heart back, or a Holy Beam if you lost none.",
